# 50-50 onto the ledge, then I + down switches to a 5-0 mid-ledge: both count in one combo.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 176
tap grind+down 260
bot balance
run 560
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50} within 172..190
expect event grindEnd{trick=BS 50-50,reason=switch} within 255..265
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 5-0} within 255..265
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + BS 5-0,multiplier=2} within 300..560
expect no event bail
